Package: assignmentB2MingyangFan
Title: Count missing values for all columns by group
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Mingyang", "Fan", , "fanmingy@student.ubc.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The goal of assignmentB2MingyangFan is to provide a function
    that counts the number of missing values for all columns in each group of a dataset.
    This package gives users the opportunity to identify and compare these missing values.
